Cell["\<\
Here we assume two things: The mass of the dark photon is smaller than the z, \
and epsilon is a small number. This means \\[delta] is small smaller than 1.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.994925035175933*^9, 
  3.994925119784319*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"13202a53-bfff-4ae5-b58a-\
